Origin
------
This program is based on the Open Dental source code, version 24.3.63.0, as
published under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your
option) any later version. Changes made in this fork are described in the
git history and in docs/decoupling-plan.md. Features from later Open Dental
versions are re-implemented from Open Dental's public documentation; no
Open Dental binaries are decompiled.

"Open Dental" is a name of Open Dental Software, Inc. It is used here only to
say where this program comes from. Some internal names (namespaces,
assemblies and the executable) still read "Open Dental" until a later rename
step; they do not mean this program is Open Dental's product.

